# Forest Ruins ("Ruins" on the panel; Crawl's second scene): leaves fall and land (a note each), crows call (recordings), the wind sings
# the arches (bowed strings), fog banks through the arches are swells, lightning and thunder, stones fall, an owl
# and bats by night; black keys call a crow, sing an arch, send a gust, a fog bank, a stone, lightning; each mood its
# own sound and picture: Dawn Mist fog and a pale sun, Overgrown ivy and leaves thick, Storm rain and the arches
# singing, Owl Moon the moon and bats
# (the simulator boots into Sakura; Forest Ruins is the third from the end there, before Frozen Lake and Night Sky:
# PRESETS three back. Long Night starts wherever its day is, by the seed, so the first minute's counts are bounds any
# quarter meets)
wait 800
spin PRESET -1
wait 150
spin PRESET -1
wait 150
spin PRESET -1
wait 1500
expect scene 4
expect knob0 0
expect knob1 25
expect knob8 0
expect knob9 40
expect textfit 0
peakreset
wavgain 24
wav forest.wav
wait 60000
wavstop
expect frleaves >0
expect gusts >0
expect drones >0
expect nvoices <13
expect peak_db_max -27
expect peak_db_min -40
shot forest.png
# black keys: the first four a crow each (one not here calls far off)
tapkey b0
wait 100
expect caws >0
expect frnote 0
# the next three an arch each; then a gust, a fog bank, a stone, lightning (its thunder after)
tapkey b4
wait 100
expect harps >0
expect frnote 4
tapkey b7
wait 2000
expect frwind >40
tapkey b8
wait 3000
expect frfog >60
tapkey b9
wait 3000
expect stones >0
tapkey b10
wait 100
expect bolts 1
wait 4000
expect thunders 1
# white keys: sixteen notes rising from 2; a leaf lets go above each
tapkey w0
wait 100
expect frnote 2
expect lastkey 2
tapkey w15
wait 100
expect frnote 17
# Mood (KNOB 1): Dawn Mist, Aeolian: a pale sun, thick fog, one crow far off, the bell
spin K1 1
wait 500
expect knob0 1
expect scalenow 3
expect keyoff 0
expect knob2 2
expect knob8 0
wait 12000
expect frcrows <3
expect sunup 1
expect frfog >80
shot forest-dawn.png
# Overgrown, Dorian: three crows on the wall, the cathedral choir, leaves thick
spin K1 1
wait 20000
expect knob0 2
expect scalenow 4
expect knob2 1
expect knob8 4
expect frcrows 3
expect sunup 0
expect frfog <30
expect scnotes >3
shot forest-overgrown.png
# Storm, In (Phrygian) a fifth down: rain, wind, the arches singing, four crows
spin K1 1
wait 30000
expect knob0 3
expect scalenow 0
expect keyoff -700
expect frrain >50
expect frwind >25
expect frcrows 4
expect harps >1
shot forest-storm.png
# Owl Moon, Min'yo a fourth down: the moon, no crows, no rain, one voice
spin K1 1
wait 15000
expect knob0 4
expect scalenow 2
expect keyoff -500
expect knob8 1
expect moonup 1
expect frcrows 0
expect frrain <5
shot forest-moon.png
# round to Long Night again
spin K1 1
wait 500
expect knob0 0
# pixel art, and a new ruin (other arches, another wall)
tap GLO
wait 1500
expect style 1
shot forest-pixel.png
tap GLO
wait 1500
tap PLAY
wait 2500
expect regrows 1
shot forest-regrown.png
# back to the instrument: everything lets go, the instrument's own scale again
press HOME
wait 800
release HOME
wait 9000
expect mode 0
expect nvoices 0
expect par1 0
expect stale 0
